(1) 3694/    1128 :                     ;
(1) 3695/    1128 :                     ; On the 68K side YOU MUST CALL
(1) 3696/    1128 :                     ; gemaSendRam manually and every time, normally
(1) 3697/    1128 :                     ; from a Vblank wait-loop.
