(1)    4/    4E74 :                     ;
(1)    5/    4E74 :                     ; comm port setup:
(1)    6/    4E74 :                     ; comm0-comm7  | FREE to USE
(1)    7/    4E74 :                     ;                If any ERROR occurs: the ports comm2 and comm4
(1)    8/    4E74 :                     ;                will return the a error number and the CPU
(1)    9/    4E74 :                     ;                who got the error.
(1)   10/    4E74 :                     ; comm8-comm11 | Reserved to Z80 for reading the PWM table
(1)   11/    4E74 :                     ; comm12       | Master CPU control (see master_loop)
(1)   12/    4E74 :                     ; comm14       | Slave CPU control (see slave_loop)
